-pan-yue:p020:m0232","surface":"豹","start":232,"end":233,"person_id":"nhc_wf5_i6y","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-055-pan-yue:p020:m0237","surface":"據","start":237,"end":238,"person_id":"pme_y32_o0d","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-055-pan-yue:p020:m0241","surface":"詵","start":241,"end":242,"person_id":"riu_pjk_vqd","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-055-pan-yue:p020:m0262","surface":"釋","start":262,"end":263,"person_id":"2k5_8k3_74m","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-055-pan-yue:p020:m0264","surface":"伯武","start":264,"end":266,"person_id":"o9k_u0j_cxg","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-055-pan-yue:p020:m0272","surface":"豹女","start":272,"end":274,"person_id":"22m_7n0_ld0","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-055-pan-yue:p020:m0276","surface":"母","start":276,"end":277,"person_id":"5mh_997_20u","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-055-pan-yue","book_id":"b-jinshu-055","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-055-pan-yue-ws2316433"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-prince-lun:p005","text":"淮南王允、齊王冏以倫、秀驕僭，內懷不平。秀等亦深忌焉，乃出冏鎮許，奪允護軍。允發憤，起兵討倫。允既敗滅，倫加九錫，增封五萬戶。倫偽為飾讓，詔遣百官詣府敦勸，侍中宣詔，然後受之。加荂撫軍將軍、領軍將軍，馥鎮軍將軍、領護軍將軍，虔中軍將軍、領右衛將軍，詡為侍中。又以孫秀為侍中、輔國將軍、相國司馬，右率如故。張林等並居顯要。增相府兵為二萬人，與宿衛同，又隱匿兵士，眾過三萬。起東宮三門四角華櫓，斷宮東西道為外徼。或謂秀曰：「散騎常侍楊准、黃門侍郎劉逵欲奉梁王肜以誅倫。」會有星變，乃徙肜為丞相，居司徒府，轉准、逵為外官。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":67,"last_line":67,"raw_start":6185,"raw_end":6445,"raw_character_offsets":[6187,6188,6189,6190,6191,6192,6193,6194,6195,6196,6197,6198,6199,6200,6201,6202,6203,6204,6205,6206,6207,6208,6209,6210,6211,6212,6213,6214,6215,6216,6217,6218,6219,6220,6221,6222,6223,6224,6225,6226,6227,6228,6229,6230,6231,6232,6233,6234,6235,6236,6237,6238,6239,6240,6241,6242,6243,6244,6245,6246,6247,6248,6249,6250,6251,6252,6253,6254,62